# ============================================================================
# LCARS-FimTale — files that must never be committed
# ============================================================================
# The site is plain static HTML/CSS/JS, so nothing here is generated. This list
# exists to keep secrets and scratch files out of the published repository.
#
# IMPORTANT: FimTale API credentials must never be committed. The official API
# documentation says so explicitly:
#   "切勿在公开仓库、前端代码或日志中明文保存 APIPass"
# The app stores them in the browser's localStorage at runtime, which is not part
# of the repository — this file guards against someone pasting them into a file.
# ============================================================================

# --- credentials and local configuration ------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
credentials.json
secrets.json
config.local.js
config.local.json

# A local endpoint override for development (never commit a personal one).
api-config.local.html

# --- local scratch / debug files --------------------------------------------
# Diagnostic scripts, captured API responses, drafts.
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
*~
_scratch/
scratch/
debug/
probe/
_audit/
# A one-off diagnostic page or script dropped in the repository root.
debug.html
debug*.js

# Captured responses may contain private data (novels, comments, user info).
response.json
*.response.json
*.dumped.json
*.har

# --- editor / IDE ------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
*.code-workspace

# --- operating system --------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- node / tooling (not used to build this site, but keep the tree clean) ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# --- caches ------------------------------------------------------------------
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.temp/
tmp/
